WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:00.740
So you're interested

00:00.740 --> 00:01.440
in getting a legacy

00:01.440 --> 00:02.320
video done, but you're

00:02.320 --> 00:03.320
curious how it works.

00:03.320 --> 00:04.220
Let me explain.

00:04.220 --> 00:05.140
You can pick a location

00:05.140 --> 00:06.100
and we'll come to you,

00:06.100 --> 00:07.120
or we can pick

00:07.120 --> 00:08.560
a studio in Victoria.

00:08.560 --> 00:09.660
Our team of expert

00:09.660 --> 00:10.960
videographers will come

00:10.960 --> 00:12.020
set up a beautiful-looking

00:12.020 --> 00:13.040
interview — think

00:13.040 --> 00:14.400
Netflix documentary.

00:15.000 --> 00:16.140
Our well-thought-out

00:16.140 --> 00:16.940
questions will help

00:16.940 --> 00:17.540
guide you through

00:17.540 --> 00:18.560
the storytelling process,

00:18.560 --> 00:19.320
because we all know

00:19.320 --> 00:19.900
it can be daunting

00:19.900 --> 00:21.200
being on camera.

00:21.200 --> 00:21.680
If you have any more

00:21.680 --> 00:22.640
questions, feel free

00:22.640 --> 00:23.400
to reach out.
